# __TITLE__

A video project of AIVideoGenerator.

- `narration.py`: the script, beat by beat
- `scenes/`: one Manim scene for each chapter (`chNN_name.py`)
- `video.toml`: language, speech engine, voice
- `build/`: voice clips, time lines, previews (generated)
- `out/`: the video, the subtitles, the chapters (generated)

## Commands

Do these commands in this folder:

```bash
videogen extract <url>        # optional: a web article to text and figures
videogen tts                  # make the voice clips
videogen check                # run the scenes: find layout, cue and pace problems
videogen render --quality l   # preview at 480p
videogen sheet                # contact sheets: one frame at the end of each beat
videogen render               # final render at 1080p60
videogen assemble             # the film, the subtitles, the chapters
videogen script               # script.md: the narration with time codes
```
